    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-ink/62"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 [text-shadow:0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">
      <p data-animate="fade-up" class="font-mono text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#bcd8f0]">PPR &amp; procedures</p>
      <h2 data-split class="mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] font-normal leading-[1.02] text-white">Call the tower first.</h2>
      <p data-animate="fade-up" data-animate-delay="0.05" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/95">Prior Permission Required for all flights. Contact ATC before planning an arrival or departure at Carrickfinn.</p>

      <div data-animate="fade-up" class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white/15 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="group bg-black/35 p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-black/50">
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/90">ATC</p>
          <p class="mt-3 inline-block origin-left font-mono text-lg text-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">+353 74 9548604</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm text-white/70">atc@donegalairport.ie</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group bg-black/35 p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-black/50">
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/90">Fax</p>
          <p class="mt-3 inline-block origin-left font-mono text-lg text-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">+353 74 9562916</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group bg-black/35 p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-black/50">
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/90">ATIS</p>
          <p class="mt-3 inline-block origin-left font-mono text-lg text-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">129.930 MHz</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm text-white/70">Listen before first call</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-animate="fade-up" class="mt-10 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#bcd8f0]">Arrival</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90">Clearance to enter the CTR is issued by Donegal ATC on 129.805 MHz. Arriving aircraft call no later than 25 DME IFN. Shannon usually clears descent to the lowest usable level (FL080 / transition level if higher) before hand-off.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#bcd8f0]">VFR traffic</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90">VFR flights need ATC clearance to enter the CTR — Class C within ATS hours, Class G outside. Join as instructed and maintain active listening on 129.805 MHz.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#bcd8f0]">Communication failure</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90">Act in accordance with ICAO Annex 2. Squawk 7600 and continue as last cleared, or follow the published lost-comms procedure for the arrival in use.</p>
